</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Murray’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$24.2m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$60.51m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played two seasons at Iowa and Sacramento took him fourth in 2022, two months before he turned 22.</p>

